%% Cloudflare R2 upload/download flow — PROPOSED

sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Server route
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant R2 as Cloudflare R2

  Note over C,R2: Upload
  C->>S: request upload (class/file)
  S->>DB: membership + quota check
  S-->>C: signed PUT URL + objectKey
  C->>R2: PUT bytes
  R2-->>C: 200 OK
  C->>S: confirm upload
  S->>DB: persist metadata row
  Note over C,R2: Download
  C->>S: request download
  S->>DB: authz + ownership check
  S-->>C: signed GET URL
  C->>R2: GET bytes
  R2-->>C: file bytes
